(Brightwave Labs - Employee Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Welcome to Brightwave Labs. This handbook explains how we work, what we expect from each) Tj T*
(other and what you can expect from the company. It applies to every employee and) Tj T*
(contractor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Working hours. Core hours are 10:00 to 15:00 in your local time zone. Outside core hours) Tj T*
(you choose your schedule, as long as your team can reach you for planned meetings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Remote work. Employees may work remotely up to three days per week. Managers must) Tj T*
(approve exceptions in writing. Fully remote contracts are available for roles marked as) Tj T*
(remote-first in the job description.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
