(Time off) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Vacation. Every employee receives twenty days of paid vacation per year. Unused days) Tj T*
(expire on March 31 of the following year. Vacation requests must be submitted at least) Tj T*
(two weeks in advance, except for emergencies.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sick leave. Employees receive ten paid sick days per year. A medical certificate is) Tj T*
(required after three consecutive days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Parental leave. The primary caregiver receives sixteen weeks of paid leave and the) Tj T*
(second caregiver receives eight weeks. Leave can be taken at any time during the first) Tj T*
(year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Public holidays. The company follows the public holidays of the country in your) Tj T*
(contract.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
