BT /F1 11 Tf 56 790 Td 15 TL
(Expenses and equipment) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Equipment. The company provides a laptop and a monitor to every employee. Equipment is) Tj T*
(replaced every four years or earlier if it fails. Return all equipment within ten days) Tj T*
(after leaving the company.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Expenses. Submit receipts through the expense portal within thirty days. Travel must be) Tj T*
(booked through the approved agency. Meals while travelling are reimbursed up to fifty) Tj T*
(dollars per day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Learning budget. Each employee has an annual learning budget of one thousand dollars for) Tj T*
(courses, books and conferences. Unused budget does not roll over.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Security. Use the company password manager and enable two-factor authentication on every) Tj T*
(work account. Report lost devices to the security team within one hour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
